[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.4[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Genessa's Faithful Doubles and Stray Doubles now appear as ghostly copies of Profane Proxima v0.2.0 (id eins0fx.thornyproxima), in both the Human and Proxima variants, including the heels, the flowing metal and the glow, like they already do for Unholy Genessa and Eve.
[/list]

[b]CSS Shared Assets 1.0.4[/b]
[list]
[*]Profane Proxima v0.2.0 gets mouth expressions and facial playback: 20 expressions and all six dance faces.
[*]Profane Proxima v0.2.0 keeps the shared animations and walk support it had in v0.1.0.
[*]Ships the ghost materials Genessa's doubles use for Profane Proxima v0.2.0.
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game and replace the CustomShellSystem folder with CSS 1.0.4. Keep CustomShellSystem/state and your profiles.
[*]Replace CSS_SharedAssets_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with CSS Shared Assets 1.0.4.
[*]Profane Proxima v0.2.0 needs both. Every other outfit, original shells, NPC and enemy looks and non-CSS replacement mods behave exactly as in 1.0.3.
[/list]
